Here is a trivial example of what may be happening.  Note that dataframe yy
contains duplicate values of the 'by' variable, so it is duplicated in the
merge.

xx <- data.frame(var1=c('a', 'b', 'c'), var2=c(1:3))
yy <- data.frame(var1=c('a', 'a', 'b'), var3=c(4:6))

merge(xx, yy, by='var1', all.x=TRUE, all.y=FALSE)

